\ Accepted since plan row TB2, tactic batch 3a (not supported yet, 93,
\ before it; the name kept): rwa on a goal a ≤ c after the rewrite,
\ where with_reducible rfl fails as Lean's does (the two sides differ),
\ and assumption closes it with h2.
\ Lean: theorem x_ra_le (a b c : Nat) (h : a = b) (h2 : b ≤ c) : a ≤ c := by
\         rwa [h]
theorem x_ra_le
  Nat explicit: a  Nat explicit: b  Nat explicit: c
  a b = explicit: h  b c ≤ explicit: h2
  a c ≤
:= by
  by-rwa[ ' h ]
end x_ra_le
